WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:04.400
A quick word about
Eduard's work.

2
00:00:05.590 --> 00:00:07.850
I had the idea of starting
a Telegram channel.

3
00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:12.090
I'd actually set one up
three years ago.

4
00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:14.070
A few people joined — and
that was it.

5
00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:16.990
But I really like
Telegram, because it has
no,

6
00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:19.650
let's say, the split you
get on YouTube —

7
00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:22.930
you can put folders inside
folders.

8
00:00:22.930 --> 00:00:25.510
And the moment I started
thinking about it,

9
00:00:25.510 --> 00:00:28.730
Eduard turned up out of
nowhere and helped me.

10
00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:32.230
And he sorted it all out,
put every piece in its
place.

11
00:00:32.230 --> 00:00:38.370
We classified the whole
thing.

12
00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:40.490
He built a bot right away
to make it easy to run.

13
00:00:40.490 --> 00:00:45.990
To me that is pure
wizardry,

14
00:00:45.990 --> 00:00:49.530
because I have no idea how
any of it is done.

15
00:00:49.530 --> 00:00:53.450
Things I didn't like he
fixed on the spot.

16
00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:59.250
The man thinks that fast
and that clearly — a
pleasure to work with.

17
00:00:59.250 --> 00:01:07.490
Every issue I raised was
sorted out right away.

18
00:01:07.490 --> 00:01:12.600
I'm really happy with his
work.

